>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Program manajemen-memori: 0.

>> txt := ['Word Salad'].
Wetonan tulis: ['Text Length: '] + txt dawa, baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: ['Character at 2:'] + ( txt karakter: 2 ), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (( txt golek: ['S'] ) - 0), baris-anyar.

Program resiki.

